  "title": "The Further Esoteric Adventures Of",
  "artist": "Trey Turner",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>This set was created as an experiment in rocking various vibes through the gradual acceleration of tempo over the course of the set.  The BPMs start around 90 and increase to 120 over the course of an hour; the goal being to do so with no clearly audible jumps. Various hip hop and glitch hop styles in play on this one; I hope you enjoy it.  The next mix from me won’t be until Flipside at the end of May 😀</p>\n<p>Thanks for listening,<br />\nTrey</p>",
